{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dodge This</strong> is a cinematic third-person multiplayer shooter that plays like an epic, non-stop action movie. Stylish stunts, 360\u00b0 aiming, and raw close-quarters gunfights combine to create the ultimate high-octane firefight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Dodge This</strong>, <strong>style means lethality</strong>. The better you master the free-flowing stunt system and 360 degree precision aiming, the more unstoppable you become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2663890/extras/77eaf62156c65f8ae3d70b5cc1d13872.poster.avif?t=1757326070\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2663890/extras/77eaf62156c65f8ae3d70b5cc1d13872.webm?t=1757326070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2663890/extras/77eaf62156c65f8ae3d70b5cc1d13872.mp4?t=1757326070\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2663890/extras/018923bbc795f170ceb5aab81711863d.avif?t=1757326070\" width=1560 height=293 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every kill charges your <strong>Timebend</strong>-meter, granting you precious seconds of slowmotion you can trigger at will. When activated, time slows for everyone nearby\u2014except you. With a slight speed advantage, you can dodge bullets and execute stylish stunts. <strong>Timebend</strong> is a tactical tool that transforms close-quarters shootouts into intense, cinematic firefights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2663890/extras/d76ded25b677bd9b9d582f6188e87ae3.avif?t=1757326070\" width=1560 height=293 /></span>Dive through windows, slide under gunfire, cartwheel across hallways, or roll into cover \u2014 all while firing in any direction with <strong>full 360\u00b0 aiming</strong>. Every move has purpose: dodge bullets, break line of sight, or reposition mid-fight without ever losing momentum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Movement isn\u2019t just traversal \u2014 it\u2019s your weapon. Mastering stunts and adapting them to the fight is how you gain the upper hand.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2663890/extras/29356b7f3c3c79a9367dc6e88404fc78.poster.avif?t=1757326070\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2663890/extras/29356b7f3c3c79a9367dc6e88404fc78.webm?t=1757326070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2663890/extras/29356b7f3c3c79a9367dc6e88404fc78.mp4?t=1757326070\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2663890/extras/770eb3ba15962ed7e1fc051324a71ff1.avif?t=1757326070\" width=1560 height=293 /></span><i>Dodge This</i> is built from the ground up to look and feel like an action movie \u2014 down to the smallest detail. Bullets leave visible trails, explosions kick up debris, and shell casings spin in the air.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic camera angles highlight stylish kills and final shots, turning your best plays into cinematic highlights. Every firefight feels like a choreographed scene of chaos and impact.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2663890/extras/c68926d914f502f6e52dcea17cbdeb08.poster.avif?t=1757326070\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2663890/extras/c68926d914f502f6e52dcea17cbdeb08.webm?t=1757326070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2663890/extras/c68926d914f502f6e52dcea17cbdeb08.mp4?t=1757326070\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2663890/extras/edc9ee37c573bbe68cbcf67498a44043.avif?t=1757326070\" width=1560 height=293 /></span>Battle across round-based, close-quarters maps in the structured <strong>Attack &amp; Defend (Push)</strong> mode. SWAT forces push forward through capture points while Suits dig in and defend. If SWAT can\u2019t capture all points before the timer runs out, the defenders win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2663890/extras/ee5c57a41b1aa60dd48bf39e868642e3.poster.avif?t=1757326070\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2663890/extras/ee5c57a41b1aa60dd48bf39e868642e3.webm?t=1757326070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2663890/extras/ee5c57a41b1aa60dd48bf39e868642e3.mp4?t=1757326070\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2663890/extras/e3eb9fb59afccf605581020885f9be45.avif?t=1757326070\" width=1560 height=293 /></span><i>Dodge This</i> gets you into the fight <strong>in seconds.\u00a0</strong>No waiting. No fluff. No cat skins. No massive updates for skins you\u2019ll never use,\u00a0 no 20-minute shader compilations, no bloat, just pure action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2663890?t=1757326070","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2663890?t=1757326070","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2663890/2d400bb0321bf54a07da7936cf0ef06794a372ee/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757326070","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2663890/2d400bb0321bf54a07da7936cf0ef06794a372ee/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757326070","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"You will send your enemies flying through windows with shotguns; they will bleed and stumble down realistically. When you get hit, you can feel the impact in your bones. Dodge This is not for the faint-hearted."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dodge This</strong> is a cinematic third-person multiplayer shooter that plays like an epic, non-stop action movie. Stylish stunts, 360\u00b0 aiming, and raw close-quarters gunfights combine to create the ultimate high-octane firefight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Dodge This</strong>, <strong>style means lethality</strong>. The better you master the free-flowing stunt system and 360 degree precision aiming, the more unstoppable you become.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline p