=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2663890/extras/edc9ee37c573bbe68cbcf67498a44043.avif?t=1757326070\" width=1560 height=293 /></span>Battle across round-based, close-quarters maps in the structured <strong>Attack &amp; Defend (Push)</strong> mode. SWAT forces push forward through capture points while Suits dig in and defend. If SWAT can\u2019t capture all points before the timer runs out, the defenders win.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2663890/extras/ee5c57a41b1aa60dd48bf39e868642e3.poster.avif?t=1757326070\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2663890/extras/ee5c57a41b1aa60dd48bf39e868642e3.webm?t=1757326070\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2663890/extras/ee5c57a41b1aa60dd48bf39e868642e3.mp4?t=1757326070\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2663890/extras/e3eb9fb59afccf605581020885f9be45.avif?t=1757326070\" width=1560 height=293 /></span><i>Dodge This</i> gets you into the fight <strong>in seconds.\u00a0</strong>No waiting. No fluff. No cat skins. No massive updates for skins you\u2019ll never use,\u00a0 no 20-minute shader compilations, no bloat, just pure action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["ShootOut Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2663890/c95244678dde181ec8bd1f8a342dfcc498b6dde1/header.jpg?t=1757326070","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimu